cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this software and the original recording dataset when using IntentLab"
title: "IntentLab: EEG decoding and command evaluation"
type: software
version: "1.3.0"
date-released: "2026-11-14"
authors:
  - name: "Jayashruthi Rajesh Babu"
    website: "https://jayashruthi.com"
repository-code: "https://github.com/shrut10/intentlab-bci"
url: "https://intentlab-bci.vercel.app"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Recorded EEG experiments and reusable tools for evaluating decoder predictions
  and the commands they produce, including participant reliability, temporal
  decision rules, instructed rest and later session evaluation
  The experiments do not establish reliable live control
  Cite the specific commit and original dataset used for reproducibility
keywords:
  - EEG
  - brain computer interfaces
  - motor imagery
  - command evaluation
  - reproducibility
